{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "投毒与假币",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 114.96,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "回到开头那笔转账。",
   "spoken": "回到开头那笔转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.6,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.008
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "这叫地址投毒。",
   "spoken": "这叫地址投毒。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 3.42,
   "dur": 1.68,
   "speechStart": 3.42,
   "speechEnd": 4.893
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "攻击者监控链上的转账，看到你的测试转账。",
   "spoken": "攻击者监控链上的转账，看到你的测试转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 5.32,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 5.414,
   "speechEnd": 9.046
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "他生成一个首尾和收款地址相同、中间不同的地址。",
   "spoken": "他生成一个首尾和收款地址相同、中间不同的地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 9.46,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 9.46,
   "speechEnd": 13.81
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "首尾加起来 8 个十六进制字符，平均只要试约 43 亿次。",
   "spoken": "首尾加起来 8 个十六进制字符，平均只要试约 43 亿次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 14.24,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 14.24,
   "speechEnd": 19.519
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "然后，他往你的记录里塞一笔 0 额或者粉尘转账。",
   "spoken": "然后，他往你的记录里塞一笔 0 额或者粉尘转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 19.9,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 19.9,
   "speechEnd": 24.005
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "这一步不需要你的任何授权。",
   "spoken": "这一步不需要你的任何授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 24.44,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 24.539,
   "speechEnd": 26.563
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "转 0 个代币，或者用他自己部署的同名假代币，都能在你的记录里留下一条。",
   "spoken": "转 0 个代币，或者用他自己部署的同名假代币，都能在你的记录里留下一条。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 26.98,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 26.98,
   "speechEnd": 33.145
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "钱包只显示地址的前后几位，两个地址看起来一样。",
   "spoken": "钱包只显示地址的前后几位，两个地址看起来一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 33.6,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 33.6,
   "speechEnd": 37.494
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "所以测试转账防不住投毒，投毒常在测试之后几分钟内出现。",
   "spoken": "所以测试转账防不住投毒，投毒常在测试之后几分钟内出现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 37.9,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 37.9,
   "speechEnd": 43.388
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "2024 年 5 月，另一名受害者复制投毒地址，转出 1155 枚 WBTC，约 6800 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 5 月，另一名受害者复制投毒地址，转出 1155 枚 WBTC，约 6800 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 43.8,
   "dur": 9.44,
   "speechStart": 43.904,
   "speechEnd": 53.0
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "经过链上喊话谈判，攻击者在约一周内退回绝大部分资金。",
   "spoken": "经过链上喊话谈判，攻击者在约一周内退回绝大部分资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 53.46,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 53.551,
   "speechEnd": 58.325
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "骗你转错是一种，骗你买错是另一种。",
   "spoken": "骗你转错是一种，骗你买错是另一种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 58.8,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 58.8,
   "speechEnd": 62.471
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "卷款，是团队撤走流动性，或者把手里的币集中卖掉。",
   "spoken": "卷款，是团队撤走流动性，或者把手里的币集中卖掉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 62.86,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 62.951,
   "speechEnd": 67.657
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "貔貅盘，是合约只允许买，不允许卖，或者卖出税 100%。",
   "spoken": "貔貅盘，是合约只允许买，不允许卖，或者卖出税 100%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 68.04,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 68.141,
   "speechEnd": 74.662
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "隐藏增发，是 owner 能无限铸币。",
   "spoken": "隐藏增发，是 owner 能无限铸币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 75.06,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 75.06,
   "speechEnd": 77.613
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "2021 年 11 月的 SQUID 代币，限制持币者卖出，开发者撤走流动性，约 338 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 11 月的 SQUID 代币，限制持币者卖出，开发者撤走流动性，约 338 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 78.0,
   "dur": 8.48,
   "speechStart": 78.0,
   "speechEnd": 86.294
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "2025 年 2 月的 LIBRA 代币，阿根廷总统发推推广后暴涨，随后崩盘。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 2 月的 LIBRA 代币，阿根廷总统发推推广后暴涨，随后崩盘。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 86.7,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 86.806,
   "speechEnd": 92.359
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "Nansen 统计，亏损的钱包合计亏约 2.51 亿美元，案件结果尚无定论。",
   "spoken": "Nansen 统计，亏损的钱包合计亏约 2.51 亿美元，案件结果尚无定论。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 92.76,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 92.858,
   "speechEnd": 100.264
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "CertiK 追踪到一个地址，在 2023 年 8 到 10 月部署 979 个貔貅盘代币，约每 30 分钟一个。",
   "spoken": "CertiK 追踪到一个地址，在 2023 年 8 到 10 月部署 979 个貔貅盘代币，约每 30 分钟一个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 100.74,
   "dur": 9.52,
   "speechStart": 100.74,
   "speechEnd": 110.084
  },
  {
